<title>USA: United Intl to sell Venezuela cable assets.</title>
<headline>United Intl to sell Venezuela cable assets.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>United International Holdings Inc said Thursday it agreed to sell its cable television assets in Venezuela for $10.5 million to privately-held SuperCable CA.</p>
<p>United International said the purchase price approximates all of its hard and soft dollar invested capital in Venezuela.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close by August 31.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
